From d073d666fcc171dc1d6e3b8c15bdda32e8e3eb31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SergiioB <sergiobarrientose@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:28:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] xpu(qwen27): XPU_ATTN_PREF prefix decode attention on the
 tensor-parallel runner

Carries the prefix attention kernels of tag b70-attn-prefix-20261113 (attn_pref,
attn_pref8, attn_tail, attn_merge2) onto #3586. The kernels take their head
counts from shape.h, so each rank runs them on its own K/V heads. attn_tail is
launched on the (slices, K/V heads, rows) grid this tree uses.

Screen, two Arc Pro B70, Qwen3.8-27B MLX 4-bit + DFlash2, 32,552-token prompt:
drafted 79.9 tok/s on one card, 101.6 on two; serial 28.0 and 44.5;
prompt 1,518 and 2,072 tok/s; drafted == serial on both.
